# Environments
.env
# The VPS's own env files (issues #65, #88). `.env` above does NOT match these
# -- a gitignore pattern with no slash matches the whole filename, so
# `dashboard.env` and `cloudflared.env` would otherwise be committed. They hold
# the Discord client secret, the bot API signing key, and the Stripe secret and
# webhook secret. The `.example` templates beside them are meant to be tracked
# and are not matched by these lines.
dashboard.env
cloudflared.env
.venv
env/
venv/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

