.ropeproject

# mkdocs documentation -- REMOVED.
#
# This came from the standard Python .gitignore template and ignored
# `/site`, which is now the apex vrcverify.com static site (#88 phase
# 10). This project has never used mkdocs -- there is no mkdocs.yml --
# so the entry only ever stood to silently drop a committed directory,
# which it did once before anyone noticed.

